: "Find a flyer from the supermarket, on the internet or at the market."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down things you want to buy."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down the sizes and weights you want and the prices."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Give your list to a partner. Look at their list."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice asking how much things cost."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a shopping list."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use prices, weights and sizes to describe food."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask how much things cost."}]}], "type": "sena"}